anet:acknowledgmentNumber skos:definition "The source protocol's acknowledgment position or identifier, interpreted in the applicable sequence space."@en .
anet:destinationAddress skos:definition "The recipient address as text in the notation selected by the protocol profile."@en .
anet:destinationPort skos:definition "The transport endpoint number carried for the recipient; protocol meaning and allowed values come from the profile and applicable shapes."@en .
anet:etherType skos:definition "The link-layer type discriminator identifying the interpretation of the encapsulated payload."@en .
anet:protocolNumber skos:definition "The network-layer protocol discriminator identifying the encapsulated transport or next protocol."@en .
